  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International NGO Safety Organisation (INSO) Ukraina 2025-2027 - INSO Ukraine</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International NGO Safety Organisation (INSO) Ukraina 2025-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till humanit&#xe4;ra och andra ideella organisationer i Ukraina i form av tillf&#xf6;rlitliga och h&#xf6;gkvalitativa s&#xe4;kerhetstj&#xe4;nster som g&#xf6;r det m&#xf6;jligt f&#xf6;r dem att planera och genomf&#xf6;ra sin bist&#xe5;ndsverksamhet p&#xe5; ett s&#xe4;kert s&#xe4;tt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to humanitarian and other non-profit organisations in Ukraine in fulfilling their mandates by providing timely, reliable, and high-quality safety services that enable them to 
plan, operate, and deliver aid more safely.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The objectives of the contribution are as follows:

- Support the re-establishment of capacity development and safety training for humanitarian organizations operating in Ukraine, which were significantly reduced due to the withdrawal of USAID funding.

- Enhance INSO&apos;s ability to provide safety services  including security updates, analytical reports, training, and crisis management  free of charge to over 312 supported NGOs (including 104 Ukrainian NGOs).

- Enable the recruitment of a regional analyst, strengthening the analytical capacity of INSO in Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
